@stevefaulkner OK, thanks. The spec currently has a similar example with `<header>`: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/sections.html#the-header-element

I think the content model should be more explicit, like this:

> Zero or more `p` elements, followed by one `h1`, `h2`, `h3`, `h4`, `h5`, or `h6` element, followed by zero or more `p` elements, optionally intermixed with script-supporting elements.

